# What a build of the skeleton templates in place leaves behind: an editor's C#,
# Go, Rust or TypeScript tooling may restore or build the template projects.
# None of it is a template (src/core/skeleton.ts BUILD_OUTPUT_DIRS skips it when
# the templates are read, and .vscodeignore keeps it out of the package). This
# file sits above the parts (common/, csharp/, ...), so it is never a template
# itself; a part's own .gitignore template is its dot.gitignore.
**/artifacts/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vs/
**/TestResults/
**/go.sum
**/Cargo.lock
**/package-lock.json
